  "question": {
    "text": "If $\\mathrm{f}: \\mathrm{S} \\rightarrow \\mathbb{R}$ where $S$ is the set of all non-singular matrices of order 2 over $\\mathbb{R}$ and $f\\left[\\left(\\begin{array}{ll}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{array}\\right)\\right]=a d-b c$, then",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
